    turnFlow: "1. The lead player plays 1-3 cards face-down and declares a rank (e.g., 'Three Kings').\n2. The next player MUST play the same rank. They can tell the truth or lie.\n3. This continues until a player is challenged or everyone passes (starting a new rank).",
